  "section_notes": "The final S2 removes any automatic sales prohibition for models above 5% and keeps per-model results away from the public, which mainly protects Northwind's Hearth 10 (6.2%). S5 makes a numeric recall mandatory at 8 per 100,000 with no transition, which triggers a recall for Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9). S1 covers only runaway, fire and injury, leaving minor overheating and smoke events outside the reporting duty and setting no deadline for them."
